<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n34164" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμμηνος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μήν</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>lasting a month</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμμηνον
				τὰν περίοδον ἀποδίδωτι</span>, of the moon, <i><span class="en">
				Ti.Locr.
				96d
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περίοδος</span>, of women, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.495e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Lg.</u>
					956a
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>done</i> or <i>paid every month, monthly</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					281
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				828c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σιτηρέσιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Caes.</u>
					8
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁρμαλιήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					16.35
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in Law,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ. δίκαι</span> suits <i>in which
				judgement must be given within thirty days</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				37.2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ath.</u>
				52.2
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰσάγειν ἔμμηνα</span>
				ib.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔ., τά</span>,
				<i>the menses</i> of women, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				3.36
			</span></i>,al.: sg., <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.19
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> neut.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔμμηνα</span> as Adv.,
				<i>in the course of a month,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				IG
				12.65.47
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
